  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A NES remake of the classic DOS shareware &quot;Hexxagon&quot;, originally by Jason Blochowiak. Strategically replicate and jump your pieces to capture adjacent opposing pieces and gain control of the board. A simple mechanic, with a nearly infinite range of gameplay scenarios. Once you've mastered the classic board, the integrated editor allows you to create and play challenges of your own design!"
    }
